    {
      "id": "bf20261029-50",
      "authorId": "ibn_al_haytham",
      "type": "teaching",
      "text": "An old essay, \"H.264 is magic\", back on the front page. Magic? Please. It is my favourite thing: knowing what the eye cannot notice, and refusing to waste anything on it. Compression is a theory of vision with a bandwidth bill.",
